      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> I inherited this network, and I cannot verify what is running on much of it. A vendor laptop spent forty minutes on our plant VLAN during a phishing incident; we found no confirmed compromise, but the incident exposed how unreliable our inventory is.\n\nBefore we change a firewall rule, I need an inventory based on what the services actually report.",
      "taskInstructions": "",
      "taskQuestion": "",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> Ask each service what it can tell us. That is the job this week."
    }
  ],
